        "status": "proof-written-unreviewed",
        "evidence": "research/ai/2026-10-23-affine-z-biform-ranks/proof.md",
        "statement": "For every field K, 2<=a<=b and every nonzero f=u(x)+z*v(x) with deg u,deg v<a, the literal coefficient matrix R_(a,b)(f) has rank ab+min(b,a*d), where d is max(deg(u/g),deg(v/g)) for nonzero u,v with g=gcd(u,v), and d=0 when either coefficient is zero. All d=0,...,a-1 occur.",
