        ],
        "limitations": "One specified two-sided conjugation family with constant long-leg compressions. The necessary rank-loss locus is not classified. Moving compressions, other source paths and other nilpotent factors remain outside the result. Exact coefficient replay and same-session proof checks are not independent mathematical review. No full target, formalization or exponent improvement."
